        "thought_text": "Model the arrangement as placing K blue balls into i groups separated by at least one red ball, then distributing the remaining N-K-i red balls freely among the i+1 gaps (before first group, between groups, after last group) using stars and bars, multiplied by the number of ways to choose which specific blue balls form the groups (which is 1 since they are indistinguishable) and the number of ways to choose positions for the groups.",
